--- a/README
+++ b/README
@@ -12,3 +12,16 @@ Currently implemented features:
 
 This project depends on libz for gzip decompressing and compressing, and a compiler
 with C99 support.
+
+## Using cNBT from CMake / vcpkg
+
+The project installs a CMake package named `cnbt`. After installation (or via
+vcpkg's overlay port in `vcpkg-port/`), consume it as follows:
+
+    find_package(cnbt CONFIG REQUIRED)
+    target_link_libraries(your_target PRIVATE cnbt::nbt)
+
+The public headers are installed under the `cnbt/` prefix:
+
+    #include <cnbt/nbt.h>
+
